msgid "Assembly input and rejected selections"
msgstr "装配输入与拒绝规则"

msgid ""
"The authored configuration authority is one schema-2 TOML assembly. SoC and "
"Board facts remain maintained JSON; `resolved.json` is output, not an "
"authored alternative. CMake owns software dependencies. Failed TOML "
"resolution never falls back to Kconfig, cache variables, schema-1 JSON or "
"old generated headers."
msgstr ""
"配置权威是一份人工编写的 schema-2 TOML 装配。SoC 和 Board 事实保持维护中的 JSON；`resolved.json` "
"是输出，不是另一份人工编写的输入。CMake 拥有软件依赖。TOML 解析失败绝不回退 Kconfig、缓存变量、schema-1 JSON "
"或旧生成头。"

msgid ""
"Before running the resolver, prepare the [fixed source and recursive "
"dependencies](../../guides/source-checkout.md)."
msgstr "运行解析器前，先准备[固定源码与递归依赖](../../guides/source-checkout.md)。"

msgid "Complete maintained input"
msgstr "完整维护输入"

msgid "Complete Native UART assembly, parsed by the production resolver."
msgstr "完整 Native UART 装配，由生产解析器解析。"

msgid "Selection"
msgstr "选择"

msgid "Meaning and rejection boundary"
msgstr "含义与拒绝边界"

msgid "`schema = 2`"
msgstr "`schema = 2`"

msgid "Authored TOML generation; unknown keys reject"
msgstr "人工编写的 TOML 生成；未知键拒绝"

msgid "`board`"
msgstr "`board`"

msgid "Maintained immediate child of `boards/`; exactly one Board selector"
msgstr "`boards/` 的维护中直接子目录；必须恰好选择一个 Board"

msgid "`board_package`"
msgstr "`board_package`"

msgid "External package path relative to the assembly; alternative to `board`"
msgstr "相对装配定位的外部包路径；与 `board` 二选一"

msgid "`backend`"
msgstr "`backend`"

msgid ""
"Explicit `native`, `baremetal`, `freertos` or supported `threadx` subset"
msgstr "显式 `native`、`baremetal`、`freertos` 或受支持 `threadx` 子集"

msgid "`clock`"
msgstr "`clock`"

msgid "Maintained exact profile matching Board and SoC facts"
msgstr "匹配 Board 与 SoC 事实的维护中精确配置"

msgid "`optimization`"
msgstr "`optimization`"

msgid ""
"Maintained optimization/debug/LTO profile; no arbitrary compiler override"
msgstr "维护中的优化/调试/LTO 配置；不接受任意编译器覆盖"

msgid "`[memory]`"
msgstr "`[memory]`"

msgid "Byte budgets for stack, libc heap, static RAM and Flash LOAD"
msgstr "以字节记录栈、libc 堆、静态 RAM 和 Flash LOAD 预算"

msgid "`[factory]`"
msgstr "`[factory]`"

msgid "Explicit optional strong IDs and capability metadata"
msgstr "显式可选强类型 ID 和能力元数据"

msgid "Kind instance table"
msgstr "类别实例表"

msgid "Stable authored name, reviewed binding, mode and bounded options"
msgstr "稳定人工编写的名称、复核绑定、模式与有界选项"

msgid "SPI/I2C device table"
msgstr "SPI/I2C 器件表"

msgid "Separate endpoint identity tied to an existing controller"
msgstr "关联已有控制器的独立端点身份"

msgid "`[abi]`"
msgstr "`[abi]`"

msgid ""
"Assert reviewed CPU architecture/FPU/float ABI; cannot invent chip features"
msgstr "断言复核 CPU architecture/FPU/float ABI；不能虚构芯片特性"

msgid ""
"Resource checks cover actual pin/AF, controller, IRQ ceiling, shared "
"timer/timebase, physical DMA controller/stream, clock, exact memory domain, "
"mode and endpoint identity. A syntactically valid selector can still reject "
"because that provider does not implement the route. The resolver never "
"silently changes pins, modes or clock."
msgstr ""
"资源检查覆盖实际引脚／AF、控制器、IRQ 系统调用优先级阈值、共享定时器／时间基准、物理 DMA "
"控制器／流、时钟、准确内存域、模式及端点身份。即使选择项语法合法，仍可能因提供者未实现该路由而被拒绝。解析器绝不静默改变引脚、模式或时钟。"

msgid "Inspect and generate"
msgstr "检查并生成"

msgid "Run from the repository root, using a new output you own:"
msgstr "从仓库根目录执行，使用自己拥有的新输出："

msgid ""
"`check` and `explain` do not generate output. `generate` publishes one "
"atomic owned bundle; failure invalidates its owned output without replacing "
"unrelated data. Inspect `resolved.json`, input identities, generated "
"`nexus_config.h`, bindings, factory, linker memory and budgets. Changing "
"declared inputs requires a fresh resolution; separate Board/backend "
"combinations use separate build roots."
msgstr ""
"`check` 与 `explain` 不生成输出。`generate` 发布一个原子自有 bundle；失败使其自有输出失效，不替换无关数据。检查 "
"`resolved.json`、输入身份、生成的 "
"`nexus_config.h`、绑定、factory、链接器内存和预算。声明输入变化要求重新解析；不同 Board/backend "
"组合使用独立构建根目录。"

msgid ""
"CPU-only Runtime has a separate authored runtime TOML using the shared CPU "
"resolver. It emits Core/Arch/optional OS policy, no "
"SoC/Board/startup/factory. Do not use it to claim a full device platform. "
"The [build contract](../../design/build-system.md), [integration "
"contract](../../design/integration-contracts.md) and production field "
"model/schema own detailed accepted fields; editor completion does not "
"establish hardware capability."
msgstr ""
"CPU-only Runtime 使用独立人工编写的 runtime TOML 和共享 CPU 解析器。它只生成 Core/Arch/可选 OS "
"策略，不生成 SoC/Board/startup/factory。不得据此声明完整设备平台。[构建合同](../../design/build-"
"system.md)、[接入合同](../../design/integration-contracts.md)和生产字段模型／schema "
"拥有详细合法字段；编辑器补全不建立硬件能力。"
